<!doctype lake><title>𝑮𝒆𝒏𝑨𝑰-𝑺𝒂𝒌𝒖𝒓𝒂-𝑰𝑽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="KxUOB" id="KxUOB" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uac5a6468" id="uac5a6468">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u87eac9d0" id="u87eac9d0"> 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u6432a224" id="u6432a224"><strong><span data-lake-id="u43af6c57" id="u43af6c57">扩散模型，又称基于分数的生成模型，近年来在多个生成任务中取得成功，尤其在图像生成、音频合成和视频生成等领域表现突出</span></strong></p><ul list="u340da283"><li fid="uc5e405d0" data-lake-id="ufb1e8561" id="ufb1e8561"><span data-lake-id="u43252203" id="u43252203">扩散模型的一个核心特征是其</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udff60628" id="udff60628" style="color: #00346B">迭代式采样机制</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4027baf5" id="u4027baf5">：模型从随机噪声出发，通过逐步去噪的方式生成目标样本。这种迭代过程为模型提供灵活的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4915fb2" id="ub4915fb2">计算开销—生成质量权衡</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u18e0e0dc" id="u18e0e0dc">，即通常随着采样步数的增加和计算资源的投入，生成样本的质量也会相应提升</span></li><li fid="uc5e405d0" data-lake-id="u3f0e6d67" id="u3f0e6d67"><span data-lake-id="u30061146" id="u30061146">迭代机制也是扩散模型具备多种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u747b4205" id="u747b4205" style="color: #00346B">零样本数据编辑能力</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue1f38836" id="ue1f38836">的重要基础，使其能够在无需专门任务训练的情况下，处理包括图像修补、图像着色、基于笔画引导的图像编辑，以及计算机断层扫描和磁共振成像重建等一系列具有挑战性的逆问题</span></li><li fid="uc5e405d0" data-lake-id="u402af213" id="u402af213"><span data-lake-id="u4530b192" id="u4530b192">然而，与 GAN、VAE 以及正规化流等</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8000fac1" id="u8000fac1">单步生成模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9868296f" id="u9868296f">相比，扩散模型的迭代式生成过程通常需要高出 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc9c89367" id="uc9c89367">10 至 2000 倍</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u46cbc01e" id="u46cbc01e">的采样计算成本。这种较高的推理开销虽然带来优异的生成性能，但也导致其生成速度较慢，从而在一定程度上限制其在实时场景中的应用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue3b8d428" id="ue3b8d428"><strong><span data-lake-id="u832520c0" id="u832520c0">一致性模型的核心目标，是在保留扩散模型迭代采样优势的基础上，实现高效的单步生成。具体而言，该模型既希望具备一步生成高质量样本的能力，又希望在必要时仍可通过增加采样步数来进一步提升生成质量，并继承扩散模型在零样本数据编辑任务中的灵活性</span></strong></p><ul list="u1c4bd433"><li fid="u36a1ad76" data-lake-id="u87d204ab" id="u87d204ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95e7b203" id="u95e7b203" style="color: #00346B">基于概率流常微分方程的建模思想</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u885d4aad" id="u885d4aad">：该方法建立在连续时间扩散模型的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ff1200c" id="u7ff1200c">概率流常微分方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua264ab6d" id="ua264ab6d">之上。该 ODE 的轨迹能够将数据分布平滑地演化为易于处理的噪声分布。基于这一性质，作者提出学习一个映射函数，使其能够将任意时间步上的样本点映射回对应轨迹的起始点。该映射具有显著的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c7c1abe" id="u1c7c1abe">自一致性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2e27b4a2" id="u2e27b4a2">特征，即同一条轨迹上的不同点都应映射到同一个初始点，因此这类模型被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uae96ace1" id="uae96ace1">一致性模型</span></strong></li><li fid="u36a1ad76" data-lake-id="ub2dc9241" id="ub2dc9241"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fdbddd7" id="u7fdbddd7">兼顾单步高效生成与多步质量提升</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc1643388" id="uc1643388">：一致性模型仅需一次网络前向传播，便可将随机噪声直接映射为数据样本，从而实现高效的单步生成。进一步地，通过在多个时间步上串联一致性模型的输出，还可以像扩散模型的迭代采样过程那样，以额外计算开销为代价换取更高的样本质量，并支持零样本数据编辑等任务</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u443e513f" id="u443e513f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776229674492-86090122-4f39-4f95-a000-7bcce11ea0fc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6e08508a-720a-4412-8642-283b4add165%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud4aa646d-a232-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A620.45458984375%2C%22height%22%3A226%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A382584%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A970%2C%22originHeight%22%3A354%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROBABILITYFLOWODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A324%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A321%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEXR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A442%2C%22y%22%3A301%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEXT%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A170%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FE(XT%2CT%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OISE%22%2C%22x%22%3A839%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(X0%2C0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%2CT%22%2C%22x%22%3A351%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(X%2CT%22%2C%22x%22%3A646%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23938674%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4ff6dea2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u61823b09" id="u61823b09"><strong><span data-lake-id="u87964226" id="u87964226">为训练一致性模型，作者提出两种基于自一致性约束的方法</span></strong></p><ul list="u6912618b"><li fid="ua4872b40" data-lake-id="u7621802d" id="u7621802d"><span data-lake-id="u7937e4ad" id="u7937e4ad">第一种方法依赖数值 ODE 求解器和预训练扩散模型，在概率流 ODE 轨迹上构造相邻点对，并通过约束模型在这些相邻点上的输出保持一致，实现将扩散模型有效蒸馏为一致性模型</span></li><li fid="ua4872b40" data-lake-id="ub0a7328d" id="ub0a7328d"><span data-lake-id="u6278d1ea" id="u6278d1ea">第二种方法则摆脱对预训练扩散模型的依赖，使一致性模型可以作为一种独立的生成模型直接进行训练</span></li><li fid="ua4872b40" data-lake-id="u89b7087c" id="u89b7087c"><span data-lake-id="u29813f4f" id="u29813f4f">基于这两种训练范式，一致性模型不仅能够继承扩散模型蒸馏带来的高质量生成能力，也由此发展为一类独立的生成模型框架。值得注意的是，这两种方法均不需要对抗训练，且对模型结构的限制较少，因此能够灵活适配多种神经网络架构</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5d3487fe" id="u5d3487fe"><span data-lake-id="u855a1ba4" id="u855a1ba4">从方法效果上看，一致性模型在少步生成场景中展现出显著优势。作为蒸馏方法时，它能够实现高效的单步或少步采样；而作为独立生成模型训练时，即便不借助预训练扩散模型，也能够获得具有竞争力的生成性能。此外，一致性模型还具备良好的任务泛化能力，可广泛应用于多种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u25e6136f" id="u25e6136f">零样本数据编辑任务</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u973befe3" id="u973befe3">，包括图像去噪、插值、图像修补、图像上色、超分辨率重建以及基于笔画引导的图像编辑等</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="FLEJO" id="FLEJO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u70bf60a2" id="u70bf60a2">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u2b9c7834" id="u2b9c7834"> </span><span data-lake-id="ufa8ca6a2" id="ufa8ca6a2">𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u89199cf8" id="u89199cf8"><span data-lake-id="u7447ad5a" id="u7447ad5a">一致性模型的提出，在理论上深受</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2ca665e" id="ud2ca665e">连续时间扩散模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6d333fc9" id="u6d333fc9">框架的启发。在这一框架中，扩散模型首先通过连续注入高斯噪声，将真实数据分布逐步扩散为更简单、更易处理的噪声分布；随后再通过相应的反向过程，从噪声中恢复出数据样本。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F196609e5044ccf30940062add3127785.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VAAE5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41210292" id="u41210292">表示真实数据分布，则其前向扩散过程可由如下随机微分方程描述：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub2e10e56" id="ub2e10e56" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b3bbe0e0862714154cd2643aad2446f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lPOab%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8857077a"><li fid="u6afe8ec1" data-lake-id="u88e64528" id="u88e64528"><span data-lake-id="ude8a3bbc" id="ude8a3bbc">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa5cef51fad9b5deb42314ba69c08cadd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vqbvQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5ebb5d1" id="ue5ebb5d1">表示连续时间变量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%3E0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a396468440c64edf48c937dcb880ee7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hLVlz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4e387c8" id="ue4e387c8">为预先设定的终止时刻；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F921712808ad93876d507dc15fad2876e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yq3iv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e0250a8" id="u1e0250a8">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4084b75627b08e33eeaf0279213d535d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bqjqr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf0633a00" id="uf0633a00">分别表示漂移系数与扩散系数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bw_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff9690426398f8a4de21468c8005eac6b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wi9O2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub153ae81" id="ub153ae81">表示标准布朗运动。将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q53Zv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4361d230" id="u4361d230">的分布记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09bd2c850203216a70dc493f1f7ecd6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pRLj8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u43eb0d05" id="u43eb0d05">，因此有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0(x)%3Dp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6e3a39d4f48d54183d6cc1ac86e8c50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jOq7j%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8c86aa28" id="u8c86aa28"><span data-lake-id="ua3f11804" id="ua3f11804">该 SDE 的一个重要性质在于：存在一个常微分方程，Song 等将其称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u81230718" id="u81230718">概率流 ODE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub072e483" id="ub072e483">，其解轨迹在任意时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZvKJq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fb2fdeb" id="u8fb2fdeb">的边缘分布均服从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09bd2c850203216a70dc493f1f7ecd6f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ce0J8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud9757cdb" id="ud9757cdb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dx_t%3D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmu(x_t%2Ct)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%5E2%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x_t)%5C%5Cright%5Ddt.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F439d47580160491cca72f4f6f831d37e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tHxVB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub1c73a87"><li fid="u1cd0e948" data-lake-id="u0d908659" id="u0d908659"><span data-lake-id="u68d5c43e" id="u68d5c43e">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feda8c954a30daec03215acd25d2647bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JaScr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue97c7af0" id="ue97c7af0">是分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffba9680d14777bc4dd140a1036ebcf24.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aQDVl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73186bd5" id="u73186bd5">的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4905a59f" id="u4905a59f">分数函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0c81ea6c" id="u0c81ea6c">；因此，扩散模型也常被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3c1f6b7" id="ue3c1f6b7">基于分数的生成模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50016dd8" id="u50016dd8">。通常，SDE 会被设计为使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffabe224f6483b4556296fc576ba1a6f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YzP7F%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1519f7d3" id="u1519f7d3">接近某个易于处理的高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf94b7cf3758248bdcbfc8f8044797b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cTDsb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf6c6212a" id="uf6c6212a">。后续采用 Karras 的设定，即令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu(x%2Ct)%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6552890daee07b66474d4e143027cff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hg2Yw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u637bc5aa" id="u637bc5aa">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B2t%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Facde4648851640ca7660951180697db0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EezJC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e3d85f3" id="u3e3d85f3">。在该情况下，有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud9c98dc1" id="ud9c98dc1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3D%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cotimes%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20t%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cpi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20T%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70979b0d62f4180992a6b10cd0f98d55.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sW8Nk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9986353e"><li fid="uc1901f8c" data-lake-id="ubb05d362" id="ubb05d362"><span data-lake-id="ue0f116c8" id="ue0f116c8">在采样阶段，首先通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u073e0444" id="u073e0444">分数匹配</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1c275139" id="u1c275139">训练一个分数模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116a2f8aded766dfe942db12f1b70426.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sfDes%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f34a8c3" id="u5f34a8c3">，得到 PF ODE 的经验估计，其形式为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u73fa72ce" id="u73fa72ce" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdx_t%7D%7Bdt%7D%3D-t%5C%5C%2Cs_%5C%5Cphi(x_t%2Ct).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08e2fd089a6c7fb108c0e2ea3f0de296.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a1j3H%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u09cf9311"><li fid="u4ba90eea" data-lake-id="u302b8f4b" id="u302b8f4b"><span data-lake-id="u06abbb6b" id="u06abbb6b">上式被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a5c846b" id="u0a5c846b">经验概率流 ODE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ude699c76" id="ude699c76">。随后，从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CT%5E2I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef352a9eac845c3e402c0e29742cb2c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M53Jp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc0aeaaa" id="ubc0aeaaa">中采样得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d28525b8d6817b989978b5f1c614e15.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iuNmr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6f10fb2" id="ue6f10fb2">作为经验 PF ODE 的初始值，并利用任意数值 ODE 求解器（如 Euler 求解器和 Heun 求解器沿时间反向求解，得到解轨迹</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feb7fa19bb6941d5412e3c8b518b2dadd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rxC1a%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42f491f8" id="u42f491f8">。最终得到的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F87713dfdead0a67be733d04029e126f9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kSFpI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7753ad0a" id="u7753ad0a">可视为数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F196609e5044ccf30940062add3127785.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xReWh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue54dcb5d" id="ue54dcb5d">的近似样本。为避免数值不稳定性，通常不会将求解器真正积分到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YBayf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41a8eaa2" id="u41a8eaa2">，而是在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f8bdc8d103a3de4f781bba1fd631778.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jnwxO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue851db0d" id="ue851db0d">处停止，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r9sAG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0f51524" id="ub0f51524">为一个固定的较小正数，并将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbca895fac0e37529077018a88148ed34.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PHCy2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udbbc7442" id="udbbc7442">作为近似生成样本。按照 Karras 的设置，将图像像素值缩放到区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B-1%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe3df4a9071091f59883ac4edb91796f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jo2yi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u294e65da" id="u294e65da">，并设定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%3D80%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cepsilon%3D0.002%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F96c14de2d062e9ebf46dd8a55fcc3fe7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CzcC4%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u29f47830" id="u29f47830"><span data-lake-id="ub6e888af" id="ub6e888af">扩散模型的一个主要瓶颈在于其</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c7ca8fa" id="u9c7ca8fa">采样速度较慢</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5562a355" id="u5562a355">。显然，利用 ODE 求解器进行采样需要对分数模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F395dc7fdb98592f357a2f3d5916f0e30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Unmaf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8527b68" id="uc8527b68">进行多次迭代评估，这会带来较高的计算开销。现有的快速采样方法主要包括两类：一类是设计更高效的数值 ODE 求解器，另一类是采用蒸馏技术。然而，即便采用改进的 ODE 求解器，通常仍需要超过 10 次函数评估，才能生成具有竞争力的样本。而大多数蒸馏方法都依赖于在蒸馏之前预先从扩散模型中生成一个大规模样本数据集，而这一过程本身就具有较高的计算成本</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="IfaXW" id="IfaXW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u602f6e7a" id="u602f6e7a">🦥</span><span data-lake-id="u49e1b293" id="u49e1b293"> 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒚 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="udf5c5a40" id="udf5c5a40"><strong><span data-lake-id="u39ab8aca" id="u39ab8aca">作者提出一致性模型，这是一类在设计上原生支持单步生成的新型模型，同时仍允许通过迭代生成在样本质量与计算开销之间进行权衡，并支持零样本数据编辑。一致性模型可以通过两种模式进行训练，即蒸馏模式和独立训练模式</span></strong></p><ul list="ud7b4b8bd"><li fid="ud5ce6f09" data-lake-id="u469503d8" id="u469503d8"><span data-lake-id="u6e03ad27" id="u6e03ad27">在前一种模式下，一致性模型将预训练扩散模型中的知识蒸馏到一个单步采样器中，在样本质量方面显著优于其他蒸馏方法，同时仍可支持零样本图像编辑应用</span></li><li fid="ud5ce6f09" data-lake-id="u1ecce634" id="u1ecce634"><span data-lake-id="u1aa734e9" id="u1aa734e9">在后一种模式下，一致性模型则在不依赖任何预训练扩散模型的情况下独立训练，从而使其成为一类独立的新型生成模型</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u38b69c84" id="u38b69c84"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5f72f4b" id="uf5f72f4b" style="color: #004347">一致性模型的定义：给定概率流 ODE 的一条解轨迹</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5C%7Bx_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9beb04dde0870abc4ab5955ff20b24a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L31M7%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fc4640f" id="u6fc4640f" style="color: #004347">，将一致性函数定义为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%3A(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cmapsto%20x_%5C%5Cepsilon.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4859e3c28537e208b897c0a935b8a397.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QZizO%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card></p><ul list="u44d673f7"><li fid="udb6e473e" data-lake-id="uce6bac6b" id="uce6bac6b"><span data-lake-id="ub6c1431d" id="ub6c1431d">一致性函数具有</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u28f3e2e5" id="u28f3e2e5">自一致性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9c3cc82a" id="u9c3cc82a">性质：对于属于同一条概率流 ODE 轨迹的任意一对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc624aa8ced5facd67f704ba819b22626.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OlCqC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u14a3917b" id="u14a3917b">，其输出应保持一致，即对任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%2Ct'%5C%5Cin%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F094e26e07ecc932f2a693c420a8e1c96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AkV1w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1249d2bb" id="u1249d2bb">，都有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(x_t%2Ct)%3Df(x_%7Bt'%7D%2Ct').%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0e6a6daea547a9a27b02439d0c89fa8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wrW0B%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="udb6e473e" data-lake-id="u8ab2bd61" id="u8ab2bd61"><span data-lake-id="uecd9aec7" id="uecd9aec7">一致性模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc912d5be9fc8b9473af552e4bfc4e253.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d7I08%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67122c2c" id="u67122c2c">的目标是通过数据学习来逼近上述一致性函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hPDak%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7b302bd" id="ud7b302bd">，其核心在于学习并显式施加这种自一致性约束</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u783150f4" id="u783150f4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776317936338-6bb07017-919e-4e65-ba8a-2af3add31fb8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udf8851f4-dded-45db-bb22-9abb1c2fb50%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3caf5bec-68b3-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A460.727294921875%2C%22height%22%3A210%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A98313%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A683%2C%22originHeight%22%3A312%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ODETRAJECTORIES%22%2C%22x%22%3A242%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EXT%E4%B8%80%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A171%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A154%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEXTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A221%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FO(XR%2CT%22%2C%22x%22%3A326%2C%22y%22%3A234%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOISE%22%2C%22x%22%3A597%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(X0%2C0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A177%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%2CT%22%2C%22x%22%3A416%2C%22y%22%3A180%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XP1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A566%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfcfb%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8906290f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u145f78e0" id="u145f78e0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22c93ea4" id="u22c93ea4" style="color: #004347">一致性模型的参数化：对于任意一致性函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fead3850e69ff0a16057649b6849eed18.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LyZvK%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2faf09f4" id="u2faf09f4" style="color: #004347">，都有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(x_%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%5C%5Cepsilon)%3Dx_%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe31904511ee144f4ac377231a5ccce1d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PwPMp%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udba1e3fe" id="udba1e3fe" style="color: #004347">即当时间取边界值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c102e7a7d231bf935f9bc23417779a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fYQQd%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8858ea53" id="u8858ea53" style="color: #004347">时，函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7531952322cc608d39f33fb92cdd4948.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22awXyh%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaee3738e" id="uaee3738e" style="color: #004347">应当退化为恒等映射</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua60d2eaa" id="ua60d2eaa">。将这一约束称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9bec52de" id="u9bec52de">边界条件</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaa87de0c" id="uaa87de0c">。所有一致性模型都必须满足该边界条件，因为它在一致性模型的成功训练中起着关键作用。同时，这一边界条件也是一致性模型在架构层面最主要、最本质的约束</span></p><p data-lake-id="u31541f6e" id="u31541f6e"><span data-lake-id="u47996f2d" id="u47996f2d">对于基于深度神经网络构建的一致性模型，作者讨论两种几乎无需额外代价即可实现该边界条件的参数化方式。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde879878a6a7eef4242cd4deb0f0c4a3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cjJ7s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u791c8595" id="u791c8595">是一个自由形式的深度神经网络，其输出维度与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NxrrE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42abb3aa" id="u42abb3aa">相同。第一种方式是直接将一致性模型参数化为：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue562c3e9" id="ue562c3e9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20x%2C%20%26%20t%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%20F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%2C%20%26%20t%5C%5Cin(%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D.%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2818426d7985331ee798b35ea62f6661.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kD2EN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u392248af" id="u392248af"><span data-lake-id="u9b0ef4ed" id="u9b0ef4ed">第二种方式则利用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u877c756a" id="u877c756a">跳跃连接</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u55b08584" id="u55b08584">进行参数化，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92f9d944f8b809bcd6791b23ebfd39c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WpOMF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8da716d6" id="u8da716d6">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe89d3df40b392f835046f0a4a59de463.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fgwk9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0058244c" id="u0058244c">是可微函数，并满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3D1%2Cc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F256dc76d89edbb8bfbc44a57798222fc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22giXe9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8278bef2" id="u8278bef2">。在这种参数化方式下，只要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0abc8239951daedc594d7b5047d511dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yj7Za%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u38232122" id="u38232122">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92f9d944f8b809bcd6791b23ebfd39c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AFRJk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57d17fab" id="u57d17fab">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe89d3df40b392f835046f0a4a59de463.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZmLrl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub591a890" id="ub591a890">都是可微的，则一致性模型在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f8bdc8d103a3de4f781bba1fd631778.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MP3NO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c17e18f" id="u2c17e18f">处也是可微的，而这一点对于连续时间一致性模型的训练至关重要。参数化形式与许多成功的扩散模型具有很强的相似性，因此更便于借用成熟扩散模型中的强大网络架构来构建一致性模型</span></p><p data-lake-id="u26fa655b" id="u26fa655b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%3Dc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)x%2Bc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(t)F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37694277ca39419e9a949e05a4bf0660.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GqFhk%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ued9030a7" id="ued9030a7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%5E2%7D%7B(t%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%5E2%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%5E2%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20c_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(t%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%5E2%20%2B%20t%5E2%7D%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F900bbbc9b3c389cf8af036a38b1a7de5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AKdRw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud983ec12" id="ud983ec12"><strong><span data-lake-id="u84c3f14d" id="u84c3f14d" style="color: #101E60">一致性模型的采样：在获得训练良好的一致性模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa46e65003dab3d92f3bf8ede41499a0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wMMfp%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uab3f24bd" id="uab3f24bd" style="color: #101E60">后，可以首先从初始分布中采样</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_T%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CT%5E2I)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F98c5182fc0bdb5119a3324587fdae172.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VsUIL%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf7e53a0" id="ubf7e53a0" style="color: #101E60">然后通过一次一致性模型评估得到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Cepsilon%3Df_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_T%2CT).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ce74ab0fa94b9050ab9159250e14eb2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j3Pec%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><span data-lake-id="uc484d792" id="uc484d792">这一过程仅涉及一次前向传播，因此可以实现</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c028aa5" id="u6c028aa5">单步采样生成</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9ef4bc58" id="u9ef4bc58">。更重要的是，一致性模型也可以通过交替执行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u95403548" id="u95403548">去噪</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udb22a5c0" id="udb22a5c0">与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7d7970ed" id="u7d7970ed">噪声注入</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u53a50975" id="u53a50975">步骤，多次调用一致性模型，从而进一步提升样本质量</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud84e816d" id="ud84e816d"><span data-lake-id="u1827fa3b" id="u1827fa3b">算法 1 对这种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ff03951" id="u7ff03951">多步采样过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9b9912b8" id="u9b9912b8">进行总结。该过程赋予模型一种灵活机制，使其能够在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf15bb6c8" id="uf15bb6c8">计算开销与样本质量之间进行权衡</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u16458ed8" id="u16458ed8">。此外，这种多步生成机制在零样本数据编辑任务中也具有重要价值。在实际实现中，作者使用贪心算法来确定算法 1 中的时间点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_%7B%5C%5Ctau_1%7D%2C%5C%5Ctau_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Ctau_%7BN-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F813db0a49b46f1d60b86994a2a1f13be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VTNA1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u318470c7" id="u318470c7">。具体而言，这些时间点是逐个选取的，并通过三分搜索来优化由算法 1 所生成样本的 FID。该策略隐含地假设：在给定前序时间点的条件下，FID 关于下一个时间点是单峰函数</span></p><p data-lake-id="u57d87702" id="u57d87702" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776318654130-cef734ca-9875-4adf-a7c8-578012e03cdd.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua2842001-eea8-4abc-ab6d-fa34b4db7db%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9f35bd80-4ed9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A450.18182373046875%2C%22height%22%3A247%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A75047%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A685%2C%22originHeight%22%3A376%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM1MULTISTEPCONSISTENCYSAMPLIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A4%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A512%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTST%3ET%3E%3ETW-1%2CIITIALNOISEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A499%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUT%3ACONSISTENCYMODELFE.%2C.)%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A417%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%87R%2C-X%E5%8D%81T-6Z%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A272%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLEZWO%2CL%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A198%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X-FO%E6%96%87%2CTN)%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORN%3DLT0W-1D0%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A261%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SEGUENCEOFTIME%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A212%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OTPT%3AX%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80FE%E6%96%87R%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A299%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf9dcb609%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2051f097" id="u2051f097"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufea480aa" id="ufea480aa" style="color: #5C0036">零样本数据编辑：与扩散模型类似，一致性模型同样能够在零样本设定下支持多种数据编辑与操作任务，即无需针对这些具体任务进行显式训练。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u77c8fe19" id="u77c8fe19">例如，一致性模型定义从高斯噪声向量到数据样本的一一映射关系。因此，类似于 GAN、VAE 和正规化流等潜变量模型，一致性模型可以通过在潜空间中进行遍历，实现样本之间的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc14692e1" id="uc14692e1">插值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8cf18fc6" id="u8cf18fc6">。同时，由于一致性模型被训练为能够从任意噪声水平的输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VSFTU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ebbc4c2" id="u1ebbc4c2">中恢复</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%5C%5Cepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9051c4bf4ca2e4fa18185a0f8089938c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XPpbd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u27633c0e" id="u27633c0e">，因此它天然具备对不同噪声强度进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u002f0a4e" id="u002f0a4e">去噪</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u068e2c28" id="u068e2c28">的能力</span></p><p data-lake-id="uef73143f" id="uef73143f"><span data-lake-id="uf2eca217" id="uf2eca217">此外，算法 1 所给出的多步生成过程还可以结合一种与扩散模型类似的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b969b68" id="u5b969b68">迭代替换策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2c32ec5c" id="u2c32ec5c">，在零样本条件下求解某些逆问题。这使得一致性模型能够应用于多种图像编辑任务，包括</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e2bebb1" id="u3e2bebb1">图像修补</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub59eaf15" id="ub59eaf15">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e17bada" id="u7e17bada">图像上色</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue2758704" id="ue2758704">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8847233c" id="u8847233c">超分辨率重建</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u115d2615" id="u115d2615">以及类似于 SDEdit 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u87771a96" id="u87771a96">基于笔画引导的图像编辑</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="ZacXI" id="ZacXI" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u76e79875" id="u76e79875">🐳</span><span data-lake-id="u6fa29ae5" id="u6fa29ae5"> 𝑻𝒓𝒂𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒚 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒗𝒊𝒂 𝑫𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒍𝒍𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="udfab126d" id="udfab126d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b7713d9" id="u2b7713d9">首先介绍第一种一致性模型训练方法，即基于对预训练分数模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F395dc7fdb98592f357a2f3d5916f0e30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FgIPL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb6ae72f" id="ucb6ae72f">进行蒸馏的训练方式。讨论围绕经验概率流 ODE 展开，该方程是将分数模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F395dc7fdb98592f357a2f3d5916f0e30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uRDI5%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4469e7a7" id="u4469e7a7">代入概率流 ODE 后得到的</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf10c86e2" id="uf10c86e2">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="u132e93c8" id="u132e93c8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdx_t%7D%7Bdt%7D%3D-t%5C%5C%2Cs_%5C%5Cphi(x_t%2Ct).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08e2fd089a6c7fb108c0e2ea3f0de296.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pm1xh%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5a98e8a1" id="u5a98e8a1"><span data-lake-id="u661072d2" id="u661072d2">考虑将时间区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20T%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c831ec37d473408b4f1b60815514e5d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x0imB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc1b57196" id="uc1b57196">离散为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c8fb70448458c9f4e5869f4056971cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cWVr1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5be92d9a" id="u5be92d9a">个子区间，其边界点满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_1%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%20%3C%20t_2%20%3C%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%3C%20t_N%3DT.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7742cc1d1a172733b2f447fac27fef69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rHtx8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60fc7863" id="u60fc7863">在实际实现中，遵循 Karras 的设定，按照如下公式确定这些时间边界：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0076d814" id="u0076d814" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B1%2F%5C%5Crho%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bi-1%7D%7BN-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20T%5E%7B1%2F%5C%5Crho%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B1%2F%5C%5Crho%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Crho%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Crho%20%3D%207.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc029841c7e4ddd98664acaefeb81e5d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GikXD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u43bca424" id="u43bca424"><span data-lake-id="uc1a887a4" id="uc1a887a4">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eIo2L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf9de1855" id="uf9de1855">足够大时，可以通过数值 ODE 求解器执行一步离散更新，从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff75c8ec05ed906603ca4188dd5394743.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ACFmc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u390822bd" id="u390822bd">得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f0c19e9fbb9b3dc9339290cd4962797.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nze6N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud0a22dab" id="ud0a22dab">的准确近似。将该估计记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4dcd190564e607f343c3b0d64b237169.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e32YF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub6985a57" id="ub6985a57">，并定义为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7c273811" id="u7c273811" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%3A%3Dx_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2B(t_n-t_%7Bn%2B1%7D)%5C%5CPhi(x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D%3B%5C%5Cphi)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d72a1cd195cf18e63e57c220833ad0f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k7S3d%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue4f56a0d" id="ue4f56a0d"><span data-lake-id="u3c99902f" id="u3c99902f">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cphi)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F574042b33ced365960bd950ef6c4e85b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oVpso%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88764cc7" id="u88764cc7">表示应用于经验 PF ODE 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1d4e6931" id="u1d4e6931">单步 ODE 求解器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u16f2133f" id="u16f2133f">的更新函数。例如，当采用 Euler 求解器时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi(x%2Ct%3B%5C%5Cphi)%3D-t%5C%5C%2Cs_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24fcd5a8ff981bb6ed95b65839d7812e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zsmyo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0680b848" id="u0680b848">相应地，其更新规则为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue10b188e" id="ue10b188e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%3Dx_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D-(t_n-t_%7Bn%2B1%7D)t_%7Bn%2B1%7Ds_%5C%5Cphi(x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f9e71b9cd7831698d09d8b577aa05b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZzyJD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4c318992" id="u4c318992"><strong><span data-lake-id="uec260635" id="uec260635" style="color: #101E60">由于概率流 ODE 与 SDE 之间存在对应关系，可以通过以下方式对 ODE 轨迹上的分布进行采样：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3bf9c558" id="u3bf9c558">首先从真实数据分布中采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20x%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65f87e2746a4f47d0552b31fbca23517.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pmRFE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64466d41" id="u64466d41">，然后向其加入高斯噪声。具体而言，给定一个数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g34DL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf2c725b" id="ubf2c725b">，可先从 SDE 的转移分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5E2I)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd37982499a4a2f72da2e12280ad0361.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i06ek%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaff82936" id="uaff82936">中采样得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff75c8ec05ed906603ca4188dd5394743.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xMGWN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u572bb4ef" id="u572bb4ef">，再通过数值 ODE 求解器执行一步离散更新，计算得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd4dfb08844bb8187477032483abe7bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pHENs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4eec2f0" id="uc4eec2f0">。由此，便可高效生成概率流 ODE 轨迹上一对相邻点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%2Cx_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54e4819abf24ca3071ddd4903fc9d0f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CVIkf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18efed4e" id="u18efed4e">。随后，通过最小化一致性模型在这对点上的输出差异来进行训练。这一思想引出如下的一致性蒸馏损失</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1af1c55e" id="u1af1c55e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776328211330-37ee9282-c556-4b4e-ac9f-0610b9e8f947.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubd9a072a-4653-4a80-bc32-925027b4c82%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3f6fa702-3d70-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A733%2C%22height%22%3A304%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A145977%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1484%2C%22originHeight%22%3A615%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FDENOTESARUNINGAVERUGEOFTHEPASTVALUESOF6DURINGTHECOURSEOFOPTIMIZATION%2CANDDL%2C)ISAMERRIC%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A419%2C%22width%22%3A1394%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FUNCTIONSANISFYINGETX%2CY%3AD(X%2CY)20ANDD(X%2CY)%3D0IFANDONLYIFX%3DY.THEONE-STEP0DEESTINMATEKT.%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A463%2C%22width%22%3A1388%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHERETHEEXPECTATIONISTAKENWITHRESPECTTOXPAANNLI%2CN-I%2CANDX%2CN(X%3ATI).HERE%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A317%2C%22width%22%3A1384%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CCO(0%2C0-%3B%3A)%3A%3D%E7%94%BB%E5%85%A5(TN)D(FO(XNR%2CTN%2B)%2CFO-(S%E8%B0%A3%2CTN))%22%2C%22x%22%3A337%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A813%2C%22height%22%3A45%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I1%2CN-ILDENOTESTHEUNIJFOMNDISRIBUIONOVER1.2.%2CN-1%2CA()ERISAPOSTITIVEWEIGHINGFUNCTION%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A1386%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%24E%3A%3DXTN%2B1%E5%8D%81(TN-TN%2B1)D(XTN%2BI%2CTN%2B1%3BP).%22%2C%22x%22%3A436%2C%22y%22%3A561%2C%22width%22%3A609%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THECONSISTENCYDISTILLATIONLOSSISDEFNEDAS%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A140%2C%22width%22%3A572%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEFINITIONI(CONSISTENCYDISTILLATIONLOSS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A675%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ISGIVENBY%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A516%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.0067%2C0.0268%2C0.9733%2C0.9839%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d4cdda%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua15f47ba%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1cd990c4" id="u1cd990c4"><span data-lake-id="u6c269e21" id="u6c269e21">作者考虑三种距离度量：平方</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell_2%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67aee047b445fb5ae825a9f935cf5f73.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mciO1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued200b2c" id="ued200b2c">距离</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5C%7Cx-y%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd84d520df17f421f5afee0b71d511c0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O863u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud9c0c7cc" id="ud9c0c7cc">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff814378eceab0083189bbdb1fa0c2b65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lyDpD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue906647e" id="ue906647e">距离</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5C%7Cx-y%5C%5C%7C_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f050921b2477f5fd92e6c34d7418902.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22njS1A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u95d8efc0" id="u95d8efc0">，以及感知相似性指标 LPIPS。实验结果表明，在所有任务和数据集上，取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Clambda(t_n)%5C%5Cequiv%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfb054385d180633586316d22934f21c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zUZKl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud50194f6" id="ud50194f6">都能够取得良好效果。在实际训练中，作者通过随机梯度下降优化模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nYRKq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f853815" id="u4f853815">，同时利用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f24646f" id="u2f24646f">指数滑动平均</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue85afee1" id="ue85afee1">（EMA）更新</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb63f4e6ddce35e94d006605225e471f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lu4XA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3caecea" id="ua3caecea">。具体而言，给定衰减率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%5C%5Cle%20%5C%5Cmu%20%3C1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc0bcb4ba84754783cb4a807f2b308cba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AXE8e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0fde82d3" id="u0fde82d3">，在每一步优化之后执行如下更新：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud2619307" id="ud2619307" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-%20%5C%5Cleftarrow%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bstopgrad%7D(%5C%5Cmu%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-%20%2B%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cmu)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa04a2d4f747c7aaba6bc43bec7c8290e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K8zSD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufb9fcdd3" id="ufb9fcdd3"><span data-lake-id="u88a0476f" id="u88a0476f">作者将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e76248c5f25e7ed9524dcff3c4a20f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mp3Y4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00d4999f" id="u00d4999f">称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c638582" id="u0c638582">目标网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9608b413" id="u9608b413">，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2da87207c1fdbf12a8a5a310d2b39a04.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hLaLC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubce81b64" id="ubce81b64">称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23c4bf40" id="u23c4bf40">在线网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufea1b265" id="ufea1b265">。实验中发现，相较于直接令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3D%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d3056dc9d86a9b8c1cd4c7f38c430bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pyzw6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u156df882" id="u156df882">，EMA 更新和 stopgrad 操作能够显著稳定训练过程，并提升一致性模型的最终性能。下面，作者基于渐近分析给出一致性蒸馏的理论解释</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7f9ddbe6" id="u7f9ddbe6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776323664513-33c10b72-66b8-480a-8b1c-18fbf47f2fae.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud68fec4e-a3f8-466a-a728-005c51393da%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0bc39c6f-f618-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A799%2C%22height%22%3A241%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A128480%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1487%2C%22originHeight%22%3A449%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EG.(3).ASUMEFESATISFESTHELIPSCHITZCONDITION%3ATHEREEXISTSL%3E0SUCHTHATFORALTELE%2CT%2CX%2CANDY%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A1386%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEHAVEFE(X%2CT)-FOLY%2CT)2'LX-YL2.ASSUMEFURHERTHATFORALLNE%2CN-I.THE0DESOHERCALED%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A1389%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LETT%3DMAXNEN%2CN-NTN%2B-TAL%2CANDF(%3A)BETHECONSISTENCRYFINCTIONOFTHEEMPIRICALPF0DEIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A1390%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTN%2BHASLOCALERRORUNIFORMNLYBOUNDEDBY0(TN--TN)PT)WITHP21.THEN.IFCIN(0%2C0%3AP)%3D0%2CWE%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A1386%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEORENL(CONSISTENCYDISTILLATIONERRORBOUND)%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A769%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SUPFO(X%2CTN)-F(X%2CTN%3B%E4%B8%AD)2-0(AT)).%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A575%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HAVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.0035%2C0.0154%2C0.9942%2C0.9923%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d4c2b2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uabeb1511%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud3c98c67" id="ud3c98c67"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf452eec6" id="uf452eec6">证明思路</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udb38d459" id="udb38d459">：证明基于数学归纳法，并与经典数值 ODE 求解器全局误差上界的证明过程相平行。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb63f4e6ddce35e94d006605225e471f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tQldA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb19e25c" id="ubb19e25c">是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hGnGD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b05ccad" id="u7b05ccad">历史值的滑动平均，当算法 2 的优化收敛时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3D%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d3056dc9d86a9b8c1cd4c7f38c430bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HUVnX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e6b9b69" id="u7e6b9b69">。也就是说，目标一致性模型与在线一致性模型最终会收敛到一致。如果此时一致性模型还能够达到零一致性蒸馏损失，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u96ed1811" id="u96ed1811" style="color: #70000D">那么定理 1 表明：在一定正则条件下，只要 ODE 求解器的步长足够小，所学习到的一致性模型便能够任意逼近真实一致性函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue8e5d408" id="ue8e5d408">。需要特别指出的是，施加的边界条件</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2C%5C%5Cepsilon)%5C%5Cequiv%20x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d23fabfaaa3ca033c94d1bfb4fed219.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tw3Ys%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u853e9297" id="u853e9297">有效避免训练中出现平凡解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%5C%5Cequiv%200.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F356077698ba33fc7d43a7e08df3d393f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BUGa9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u04f44276" id="u04f44276"><span data-lake-id="ufaed51a6" id="ufaed51a6">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3D%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d3056dc9d86a9b8c1cd4c7f38c430bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yCjPV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e4d0343" id="u9e4d0343">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3D%5C%5Ctext%7Bstopgrad%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6b30b9a23719d6a7a461a6362bf02f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UCTPg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72ccc7a6" id="u72ccc7a6">时，一致性蒸馏损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCD%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-%3B%20%5C%5Cphi)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F867a2b2bfcd2a4450a350b19562cfa15.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lUuCZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u564aca08" id="u564aca08">还可以推广到</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud6cf130b" id="ud6cf130b">无限多时间步</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u33bc5838" id="u33bc5838">的情形。此时得到的连续时间损失函数无需显式指定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22avVhl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u47bb4059" id="u47bb4059">以及时间节点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_1%2Ct_2%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Ct_N%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F664108c84dff584165928d386bbc2af9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HVA4A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe7200a4" id="ufe7200a4">。然而，这类连续时间损失涉及 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud7ec2bff" id="ud7ec2bff">Jacobian-vector products</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3c57d671" id="u3c57d671">，并且为高效实现，还需要前向模式自动微分，而这在某些深度学习框架中可能并未得到良好支持</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="f2cD1" id="f2cD1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u10d26868" id="u10d26868">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u4790db97" id="u4790db97"> 𝑻𝒓𝒂𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒚 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒊𝒏 𝑰𝒔𝒐𝒍𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8a43648e" id="u8a43648e"><span data-lake-id="u3ce62721" id="u3ce62721">一致性模型的训练并不一定依赖于预训练扩散模型。这一点不同于现有的大多数扩散蒸馏方法，也正因此，使得一致性模型不仅是一种蒸馏框架，更成为一类</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue8240126" id="ue8240126">独立的生成模型家族</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u954eacae" id="u954eacae">。回顾一致性蒸馏方法可知，该方法依赖于一个预训练分数模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F395dc7fdb98592f357a2f3d5916f0e30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rIknw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u005e553a" id="u005e553a">来逼近真实分数函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feda8c954a30daec03215acd25d2647bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ScbM8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4dc8e22" id="ud4dc8e22">。然而，作者指出，实际上可以完全摆脱这一预训练分数模型，而改为利用如下</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u28e8e0b7" id="u28e8e0b7">无偏估计量</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u920bfad6" id="u920bfad6">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub3a00cad" id="ub3a00cad" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x_t)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-x%7D%7Bt%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%7C%5C%5C%2Cx_t%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc93c70a358cea9db436402b70a1952b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YmnTk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u71f2697d"><li fid="u9aa64624" data-lake-id="ub0be2ae7" id="ub0be2ae7"><span data-lake-id="u31e2b5b6" id="u31e2b5b6">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54bc95b519b13ec95210540d596c8e1f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M5sLe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u13aa1636" id="u13aa1636">且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%2Ct%5E2I).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a8c046e455882a9cd068a7195d059aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tFEux%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c301849" id="u0c301849">这意味着，在给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lUtTH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42e9fa53" id="u42e9fa53">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KSDMz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua2cd4998" id="ua2cd4998">的情况下，可以用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-x%7D%7Bt%5E2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fafc5da877896ca44e38a39b7cdb073f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yQYKp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f4476c7" id="u8f4476c7">来对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c09ce68624cd9f67000280ebe17dd13.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qQzcN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u660eea26" id="u660eea26">进行无偏估计。作者进一步表明，在采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1247b1ab" id="u1247b1ab">Euler 方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3c74c07b" id="u3c74c07b"> 作为 ODE 求解器、并考虑</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8383b3c56bec3d8fe2a5252225a1628b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g99Pc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50b5b26a" id="u50b5b26a">的极限情形时，这一无偏估计足以替代一致性蒸馏中原本所需的预训练扩散模型</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u11ad5503" id="u11ad5503" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776326971409-74b8e2ad-19f8-47e7-a92a-ac091416693c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u49bb6312-79cd-4f8e-a31c-299124060fe%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u86a59a69-df55-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A672.727294921875%2C%22height%22%3A336%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A136087%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1189%2C%22originHeight%22%3A593%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHERETHEEXPECTATIONISTAKENWITHRESPECTTOXPAN%2CN-I.ANDXNX%2CTI).THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A1102%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LETAT%3DMAXNELUX-UNFF%2B-TA.ASSUWMEDANDF-AREBOTHTWICECONTINUWOUSTYDIFERENTIABLEWITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A1105%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BOUNDEDSECONDDERIVAIVESTHEWEIGHINGFUNCIONISBOUNDED%2CANDLLOGP.(X.)F%3COO.ASSUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A1107%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FURTHERTHATWEUSETHEEIULERODESOLVERANDTHEPRE-TRAINEDSCOREMODELMATCHESTHEGROUNDTRUTH%2CI.E.%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A1110%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSISTENCYRAININGOBJECTIVE%2CDENOTEDBYLR(0.0)%2CISDEFINEDAS%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A693%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EZ~N(0.I).MOREOVER%2CCN(0%2C0)20(AT)FINFNCP(0%2C0%3BP)%3E0.%22%2C%22x%22%3A85%2C%22y%22%3A550%2C%22width%22%3A790%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%E5%85%A5(TN)D(FO(X%2BTN%2BIZ%2CTN%2B)%2CFO-(X%2BTZ%2CTN))%22%2C%22x%22%3A337%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A518%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VTELE%2CT%3ASA(X%2CT)%E4%B8%89VLOGP(X).THEN%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A434%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CP(0%2C0-%3A%E4%B8%AD)%3DCCR(0.0-)%2BO(AT)%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A383%2C%22y%22%3A296%2C%22width%22%3A426%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222(CONSISTENCYTRAININGEQUIVAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A144%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A416%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHEREZV(W.1).M%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A555%2C%22width%22%3A223%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c8d9d8%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6b1bfcaa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uccabb3cf" id="uccabb3cf"><span data-lake-id="u69f82220" id="u69f82220">证明基于泰勒展开以及分数函数的性质。作者称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud60c8183" id="ud60c8183">一致性训练损失</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uabcbb478" id="uabcbb478">。其关键之处在于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F025e015adf455e80ec45af4e67af98ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L75Jo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8bb66c67" id="u8bb66c67">仅依赖于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u590289b5" id="u590289b5">在线网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc912d5be9fc8b9473af552e4bfc4e253.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gEmjd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u10965ce0" id="u10965ce0">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ff827df" id="u9ff827df">目标网络</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e76248c5f25e7ed9524dcff3c4a20f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eEZAp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20e17de3" id="u20e17de3">，而完全不再依赖于扩散模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oNL5l%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u509e6025" id="u509e6025">。换言之，该训练目标已经完全摆脱对预训练扩散模型的依赖。同时</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-)%20%5C%5Cgeqslant%20O(%5C%5CDelta%20t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83dd5ace0d9df9b2ff58b7700e31a2b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22od7dd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1ff9a84" id="ub1ff9a84">的衰减速度慢于余项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22o(%5C%5CDelta%20t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa99e5d735214be2f41b4a7fa7a5452c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gyXDW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0edb22c7" id="u0edb22c7">。因此，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8383b3c56bec3d8fe2a5252225a1628b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kGBwX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a9375b4" id="u9a9375b4">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%20t%5C%5Cto%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe96de60d40d02a0de282306321a1faba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fWa6D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7532c2d" id="ua7532c2d">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCT%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4e2b06c91aa082688da352ef9325070f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hh2mp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1aa8d713" id="u1aa8d713">将主导整体损失，从而构成一致性模型独立训练的有效目标</span></p><p data-lake-id="u289a2412" id="u289a2412"><strong><span data-lake-id="u72967100" id="u72967100">渐进式增加时间步数的训练策略：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u14f5e6ae" id="u14f5e6ae">为在实践中获得更好的性能，提出在训练过程中按照某个调度函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff314efc0c1b2fa5801c3bd38eb22fb87.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ApuiW%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uea9f02b8" id="uea9f02b8">逐步增大时间离散步数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VR7Cb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b860870" id="u0b860870">。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vS0KJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u37afad7c" id="u37afad7c">较小时（即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbecc4fcd9d0fe1d4c9363c6e000c53ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e3pp7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9045811d" id="u9045811d">较大），一致性训练损失相对于底层的一致性蒸馏损失而言具有更小的方差但更大的偏差，这有助于训练初期更快收敛；当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jqyT2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u80b44106" id="u80b44106">较大时（即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5CDelta%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Febbbf6e369ad01314b13b0aea54b1469.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i9ap1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u83375f70" id="u83375f70">较小），其方差较大但偏差较小，这更适合训练后期用于逼近更精确的目标。作者进一步发现，为达到最佳性能，参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F03f1f619cd3b1c0c8d5b14c7221bed10.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pya4V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u058aa28d" id="u058aa28d">也应当随着</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SQGM6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d8b7c56" id="u5d8b7c56">一同变化，即按照某个调度函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb308a472cf0839045331426d8c6efcf5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YjF94%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u690387e5" id="u690387e5">动态调整</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3f4810ba" id="u3f4810ba"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub31a8b22" id="ub31a8b22">连续时间形式的一致性训练：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u78ba7a27" id="u78ba7a27">与一致性蒸馏类似，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bstopgrad%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe017c0ada67bebf5f637d96f94b103b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ashy3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa806530" id="ufa806530">时，一致性训练损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCT%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4e2b06c91aa082688da352ef9325070f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XIqlU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa154052" id="uaa154052">也可以推广到</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u461c4b83" id="u461c4b83">连续时间</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc30b7aef" id="uc30b7aef">情形。该连续时间损失函数不再需要针对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uTCwV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85a00ec1" id="u85a00ec1">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F756a643380ff53c0692dbc2e7e930a35.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XjnE9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33435f99" id="u33435f99">设计调度函数，但为高效实现，仍然需要前向模式自动微分。与离散时间下的 CT 损失不同，连续时间目标不存在不理想的偏差问题，因为此时在定理 2 中实际上已经取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%20t%5C%5Cto%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe96de60d40d02a0de282306321a1faba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lhNwa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c362240" id="u4c362240">的极限</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubf506b44" id="ubf506b44" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1776328142766-e2fcd42f-72d4-465b-9769-108fa44a55fb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u61b2146c-784a-4503-873b-f258294a134%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc69ee99a-4fd9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A748.727294921875%2C%22height%22%3A293%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A132095%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1343%2C%22originHeight%22%3A526%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLEX~D%2CANDN~UL%2CN(K)-L%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A743%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A464%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A(TN)D(FO(XTN4%2CTN%2B)%2CFO-(XE%2CTN)%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A447%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%A5(TN)D(FO(X%2BTN%2BIZ%2CTN%2BI)%2CFO-(X%2BTNZ%2CTN))%22%2C%22x%22%3A756%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A561%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N%2CSTEPSCHEDULEN)%2CEMADECAYRATESCHEDULE)%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A719%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A632%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLEXDANDN~ULN-L%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A429%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XE.%2C-XN%E5%B0%8F%E5%8D%81(TN-TN%2B)D(XTN%E5%B0%8FI%2CTN%2B1P)%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A283%2C%22width%22%3A517%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220--STOPGRAD(U(K)0-%2B(1-PU(K))0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A743%2C%22y%22%3A412%2C%22width%22%3A468%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUT%3ADATASETD%2CINITIALMODELPARAMETER6LEARNINGRATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A714%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A627%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUTDATASETD%2CINITIALMODELPARAMETER0%2CLEANNGRATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A620%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%E4%B8%800-MV0L(0%2C0-%3A%E5%8A%9B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A408%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHM3CONSISTENCYLRAININGC%22%2C%22x%22%3A703%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A453%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220-STOPGRAD(U0-%E5%8D%81(1-U)0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A400%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLEX%2C~W(XTL)%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A397%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHM2CONSISTENCYDISTILLATION(CD)%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A475%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%2CODESOLVER%E4%B8%AD(%2C%3B%E4%B8%AD)%2CD(%2C)%2CA()%2CANDJ%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A492%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNTILCONVERGENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A721%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220-0-NV0C(0%2C0-)%22%2C%22x%22%3A745%2C%22y%22%3A379%2C%22width%22%3A515%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLEZ~WOL)%22%2C%22x%22%3A749%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A268%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NTILCONVERGENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A227%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%E4%B8%80%3C-0ANDK%3C-0%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A179%2C%22width%22%3A252%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C(0%2C0-%3B%E4%B8%AD-%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D.%2C%2CANDD%22%2C%22x%22%3A717%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A455%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%E4%B8%80K%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A730%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A231%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EPEAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A730%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDEAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C(0%2C0-%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A750%2C%22y%22%3A307%2C%22width%22%3A333%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f3f1%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7cbcc035%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="wia23" id="wia23" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue35e17ce" id="ue35e17ce">🪐</span><span data-lake-id="u5a02b570" id="u5a02b570"> 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰-𝐆𝐑𝐏𝐎: 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰 𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐯𝐢𝐚 𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐑𝐋</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ud6f4c71a" id="ud6f4c71a"><strong><span data-lake-id="uab7eca3c" id="uab7eca3c">流匹配模型凭借坚实的理论基础和出色的高质量图像生成能力，已在图像生成领域占据主导地位。在构建涉及多个对象、属性及其相互关系的复杂场景 ，以及进行文字渲染时，这类模型仍然面临困难</span></strong></p><ul list="u312a804a"><li fid="u40ff3f50" data-lake-id="u809a1a54" id="u809a1a54"><span data-lake-id="u4d824b9c" id="u4d824b9c">与此同时，在线强化学习已被证明能够有效增强大语言模型的推理能力。已有研究主要关注将强化学习应用于早期的扩散生成模型，或者将直接偏好优化等离线强化学习技术用于基于流的生成模型</span></li><li fid="u40ff3f50" data-lake-id="u564ed707" id="u564ed707"><span data-lake-id="ube2dd220" id="ube2dd220">在线强化学习在提升流匹配生成模型方面的潜力，仍在很大程度上尚未得到探索</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7dc4404a" id="u7dc4404a"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4dbd87d" id="uf4dbd87d">本文研究如何利用在线强化学习，有效提升流匹配模型的能力。利用强化学习训练流模型面临若干关键挑战</span></strong></p><ul list="u52551a2f"><li fid="ubc28bf04" data-lake-id="ua9f635e4" id="ua9f635e4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u52fd9d5e" id="u52fd9d5e" style="color: #5C0036">流模型依赖基于常微分方程的确定性生成过程，这意味着它们无法在推理过程中进行随机采样。相比之下，强化学习依赖随机采样来探索环境，通过尝试不同动作并依据奖励进行改进来学习</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udfdb7000" id="udfdb7000">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udff93550" id="udff93550">强化学习对随机性的需求，与流匹配模型的确定性本质之间存在冲突</span></strong></li><li fid="ubc28bf04" data-lake-id="uf095174b" id="uf095174b"><span data-lake-id="ub0a59a52" id="ub0a59a52">在线强化学习依赖高效采样来收集训练数据，但流模型通常需要经过多次迭代才能生成一个样本，从而限制采样效率。对于大规模模型，这一问题更加突出。因此，要使强化学习能够实际应用于图像或视频生成等任务，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e9544bd" id="u8e9544bd">提高采样效率至关重要</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u413e065e" id="u413e065e">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubff504bc" id="ubff504bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u579239bc" id="u579239bc">为解决上述挑战，提出 Flow-GRPO，通过两项关键策略，将 GRPO 引入用于文生图的流匹配模型</span></strong></p><ul list="u5c5874a6"><li fid="u15f6ff60" data-lake-id="ub4eefb74" id="ub4eefb74"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d096eb5" id="u0d096eb5" style="color: #AD1A2B">首先，采用 ODE-to-SDE 策略，克服原始流模型的确定性限制。通过将基于 ODE 的流转换为等价的随机微分方程框架，在保持原始边缘分布不变的同时引入随机性</span></strong></li><li fid="u15f6ff60" data-lake-id="u5a6500b2" id="u5a6500b2"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc27afdd2" id="uc27afdd2" style="color: #AD1A2B">其次，为提高在线强化学习的采样效率，采用去噪步数缩减策略，在训练期间减少去噪步数，而在推理期间保留完整的采样调度。实验表明，使用较少的去噪步数，能够在保持性能的同时，显著降低数据生成成本</span></strong></li><li fid="u15f6ff60" data-lake-id="u6d7218d0" id="u6d7218d0"><span data-lake-id="u8774bb37" id="u8774bb37">采用不同类型奖励的文生图任务上评估 Flow-GRPO：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u84f5a490" id="u84f5a490">可验证奖励</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ube85375a" id="ube85375a">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u627d6ed5" id="u627d6ed5">基于模型的奖励</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1cfba6bf" id="u1cfba6bf">（例如用于衡量人类偏好的 PickScore 奖励）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7737dbc7" id="u7737dbc7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1b80957" id="uc1b80957">综上，Flow-GRPO 的主要贡献如下</span></strong></p><ul list="u903d7901"><li fid="u684e5641" data-lake-id="u243c8ddd" id="u243c8ddd"><span data-lake-id="uc3265812" id="uc3265812">首次通过将确定性的 ODE 采样转换为 SDE 采样，将 GRPO 引入流匹配模型，验证在线强化学习在文生图任务中的有效性。Flow-GRPO 在不明显损害图像质量的前提下，将 SD3.5-M 的准确率从 63% 提升至 95%</span></li><li fid="u684e5641" data-lake-id="u93e1c94f" id="u93e1c94f"><span data-lake-id="ua65a6791" id="ua65a6791">对流匹配模型进行在线强化学习时，收集训练样本并不需要采用标准设置中的较多去噪步数。通过在训练期间使用较少的去噪步数，并在测试期间保留原始步数，可以显著加快训练过程</span></li><li fid="u684e5641" data-lake-id="u70613e86" id="u70613e86"><span data-lake-id="ub44d190d" id="ub44d190d">Kullback–Leibler（KL）约束能够有效防止奖励投机，即以牺牲图像质量或多样性为代价来提高奖励的现象。从实证结果来看，KL 正则化并不等价于提前停止训练。采用适当的 KL 项后，尽管需要更长的训练时间，但仍能够在保持图像质量的同时，达到不使用 KL 约束时的高奖励水平</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="v5cKP" id="v5cKP" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u65cef3cb" id="u65cef3cb">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u86d32351" id="u86d32351"> 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u94b23bb0" id="u94b23bb0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u72c752fb" id="u72c752fb">扩散与流匹配：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u95c37712" id="u95c37712">扩散模型向数据中添加高斯噪声，并训练神经网络来逆转这一过程。采样时，通过离散的 DDPM 步骤或概率流 SDE 求解器，生成高保真输出。流匹配则通过直接匹配速度场，学习一个连续时间归一化流，从而仅需少量 ODE 步骤即可进行高效的确定性采样。与扩散模型相比，流匹配使用少得多的去噪步骤便能取得具有竞争力的 FID，因此已成为近期图像生成模型和视频生成模型的主流选择</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud8f67f77" id="ud8f67f77"><strong><span data-lake-id="u70fae50f" id="u70fae50f">流匹配：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf6eef179" id="uf6eef179">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde6f8681f3d7a3a0c270f15cade8e73e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZMyRA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u677e2c7a" id="u677e2c7a">为来自真实分布的数据样本，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04d4c5e2ba2eacb437fb755b8808409f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wQpmJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9742b866" id="u9742b866">为噪声样本。近期先进的图像生成模型，采用 Rectified Flow 框架，加噪数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gz8FB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufdb57e5f" id="ufdb57e5f">定义为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucf54ba6f" id="ucf54ba6f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3D(1-t)x_0%2Btx_1%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbf182edd35d1dadbd4101e0f516910.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rQXPr%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u18264f5a"><li fid="ufc2c8bb8" data-lake-id="u2d789bcb" id="u2d789bcb"><span data-lake-id="u946428cc" id="u946428cc">随后，通过最小化流匹配目标，训练 Transformer 模型直接回归速度场</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c7b18a8bc53a76deeff00164551df01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kjyvE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb81b870" id="udb81b870">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5c698cea" id="u5c698cea" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%5C%5C%2Cx_0%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D_0%2C%5C%5C%2Cx_1%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D_1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cv-v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd4e1920a063c9f2b776979d31b9af05.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h1wT0%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u34912726" id="u34912726"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf8d20060" id="uf8d20060">将去噪过程建模为 MDP：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u80366a4b" id="u80366a4b">流匹配模型中的迭代去噪过程可以形式化为马尔可夫决策过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BA%7D%2C%5C%5Crho_0%2CP%2CR)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a5b84fdf10c1942ea914d8b4d4aac3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nc3TV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud9ea765d" id="ud9ea765d">。第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pq6Th%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3aa60e67" id="u3aa60e67">步的状态定义为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_t%5C%5Ctriangleq(c%2Ct%2Cx_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90536ec5e3d599ad4e16ed1758a2b6ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K0x3L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u55c52805" id="u55c52805">，动作定义为模型预测的去噪样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a_t%5C%5Ctriangleq%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14faae42305d1237568c2261c9fd7c28.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KGxJQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f8f59ce" id="u3f8f59ce">，相应策略为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(a_t%5C%5Cmid%20s_t)%5C%5Ctriangleq%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cc).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde6ea207e2637eeda956c7d87f9eccc0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TAJWX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2027bf88" id="u2027bf88">状态转移是确定性的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P(s_%7Bt%2B1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20s_t%2Ca_t)%5C%5Ctriangleq%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cdelta_c%2C%5C%5Cdelta_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cdelta_%7Bx_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56f1341fc747ad268e34ded14a3a63fe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PH1Cs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u22affeb5" id="u22affeb5">初始状态分布为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho_0(s_0)%5C%5Ctriangleq%5C%5Cleft(p(c)%2C%5C%5Cdelta_T%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8228c5333df16daffc51b4039e5592d7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22htod0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u72e2fd0a"><li fid="uc167a370" data-lake-id="ufd436cd1" id="ufd436cd1"><span data-lake-id="ua8b4b6ee" id="ua8b4b6ee">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e6de159c2efe0eda9a530dc273ca9ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iGKjp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3da8697a" id="u3da8697a">表示以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O03c2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u592135d5" id="u592135d5">为中心的狄拉克分布。奖励仅在最后一步给出：当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X4D6w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue19725be" id="ue19725be">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R(s_t%2Ca_t)%5C%5Ctriangleq%20r(x_0%2Cc)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f1e05baa9e389fcc78440f7f84ff228.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bgfra%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1a263c5" id="ue1a263c5">；其余步骤的奖励均为 0</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="iFOEb" id="iFOEb" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u189bd73a" id="u189bd73a">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u4a21e147" id="u4a21e147"> 𝐅𝐥𝐨𝐰-𝐆𝐑𝐏𝐎</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue2facee4" id="ue2facee4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u98bd1bf5" id="u98bd1bf5">流匹配中的 GRPO：强化学习旨在学习一个使期望累积奖励最大化的策略。这一目标通常可以表述为：通过优化带正则项的目标函数，学习策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KPXeW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ude8d0368" id="ude8d0368" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmax_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(s_0%2Ca_0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cs_T%2Ca_T)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cleft(R(s_t%2Ca_t)-%5C%5Cbeta%20D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20s_t)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20s_t)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44e2217d89c7736209b28f0279b15039.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ikmth%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uad7454cf"><li fid="u88ba2639" data-lake-id="u9499222e" id="u9499222e"><span data-lake-id="ufa540940" id="ufa540940">去噪过程可以被形式化为一个马尔可夫决策过程。给定提示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yOK3c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94dc916a" id="u94dc916a">，流模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3f197b904ccc8bce421a3124813852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZKKLj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91d96715" id="u91d96715">采样生成一组包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8df64a4bfdeb9bdcbc357668b6fb123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LNfpP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ude935048" id="ude935048">张图像的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx_0%5Ei%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49b699d341f2b8fb08539c1410892a29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sTgTI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ad2a9dc" id="u2ad2a9dc">，以及相应的逆时间轨迹 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B(x_T%5Ei%2Cx_%7BT-1%7D%5Ei%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_0%5Ei)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48368bc697886d0f1415b898c9a8b0ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sq57V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u512a0911" id="u512a0911">。随后，通过对组内奖励进行标准化，计算第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yM8kL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf2522b8c" id="uf2522b8c">张图像的优势</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u20f8b201" id="u20f8b201" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BR(x_0%5Ei%2Cc)-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5C%7BR(x_0%5Ei%2Cc)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5C%7BR(x_0%5Ei%2Cc)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F15ef25a9bc4c78969f5e26f4e765d103.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PxihG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u6ac15b6d"><li fid="uacc4caae" data-lake-id="uc4966fc4" id="uc4966fc4"><span data-lake-id="u9f152024" id="u9f152024">GRPO 通过最大化以下目标来优化策略模型</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5b55afda" id="u5b55afda" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BFlow%5C%5Ctext%7B-%7DGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bc%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BC%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bx%5Ei%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20c)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Bf(r%2C%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D%2C%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5Cbeta)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fedf48149c8a7705c9cc6230fc5fbc766.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TD6ig%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6368d673" id="u6368d673" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f(r%2C%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D%2C%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5Cbeta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BT%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7BT-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_t%5Ei(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%5Ei%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_t%5Ei(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%5Ei%5C%5Cright)-%5C%5Cbeta%20D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff19434aee05c8df631dae6f5c7ee96c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D8ile%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u57b06934" id="u57b06934" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_t%5Ei(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%5Ei%2Cc%5C%5Cright)%7D%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%5Ei%2Cc%5C%5Cright)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2fc9beb8e52b9bccd79eed7eaa9e4189.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B6pKq%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6ccfc97f" id="u6ccfc97f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b69fcbf" id="u7b69fcbf">从 ODE 到 SDE。GRPO 依赖式（4）和式（5）中的随机采样，生成多样化的轨迹，以进行优势估计和探索。扩散模型天然支持这一过程：前向过程逐步添加高斯噪声，逆向过程则通过方差递减的马尔可夫链，近似实现基于得分的 SDE 求解器。相比之下，流匹配模型使用确定性的 ODE 描述前向过程</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u1fdeb327" id="u1fdeb327" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dx_t%3Dv_t%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt.%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f8a1750d281a28dbfd6a66e5c05c96a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z21rd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1d3c1088"><li fid="u77b96d64" data-lake-id="u865ea0a4" id="u865ea0a4"><span data-lake-id="u3fe6b1ac" id="u3fe6b1ac">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f78b28373820ed6ae1ed827af3b5716.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jTPsE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c2c8300" id="u0c2c8300">通过式（2）中的流匹配目标学习得到。一种常用的采样方法是对这一 ODE 进行离散化，从而在相邻时间步之间建立一一映射</span></li><li fid="u77b96d64" data-lake-id="u9e51f7d4" id="u9e51f7d4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u63120204" id="u63120204" style="color: #5C0036">这种确定性方法在两个关键方面无法满足 GRPO 的策略更新要求。 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_t%5Ei(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F82f49e28e912490c09308c9bc9a92aea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aS1H3%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub980972f" id="ub980972f" style="color: #5C0036">要求计算 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cc)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd35aeeeebb76ef36deee0654eaf8a08b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iDtEL%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub85da53f" id="ub85da53f" style="color: #5C0036">，而在确定性动力学下，由于涉及散度估计，其计算开销较高。更重要的是，强化学习依赖探索。降低随机性会显著降低训练效率。确定性采样除了初始随机种子之外不再引入任何随机性，因此这一问题尤为突出</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6a67bcf1" id="u6a67bcf1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791169717565-8f4e74fa-4a27-44f8-98c5-71960ba67e5b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6f685fe1-fd7c-4a8c-a6a3-177a17e4e8f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua03584c7-7363-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A815.2%2C%22height%22%3A493%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A272529%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1019%2C%22originHeight%22%3A616%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GROUPRELATIVEPOLICYOPTIMIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A660%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A307%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENOISINGREDUCTION(T%3D1O)%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A572%2C%22width%22%3A239%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MARKOWDECISIONPROCESSVIASDESAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A143%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A377%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DXR%3DFEDT%E5%8D%81ODW%22%2C%22x%22%3A274%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLESSUFFICEFORRL%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A574%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JFUOY-CRPODCLIP-BDKUTTETTEOIA%22%2C%22x%22%3A682%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A254%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPT%3AAPHOTOOFFOURCUPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A207%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A236%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SDESAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WOW%2CFEW-STEPLOW-GUALITY%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A555%2C%22width%22%3A218%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFLOWMATCHINGT2IMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A232%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GROUPCOMPUTAFION%22%2C%22x%22%3A736%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PTIMIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A524%2C%22y%22%3A73%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADVANTAGES%22%2C%22x%22%3A758%2C%22y%22%3A129%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A781%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N01)%22%2C%22x%22%3A74%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLICY%22%2C%22x%22%3A536%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PEWARDS%22%2C%22x%22%3A781%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2219%22%2C%22x%22%3A433%2C%22y%22%3A521%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NEASR%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A417%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A779%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FUNCTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A776%2C%22y%22%3A462%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%22%2C%22x%22%3A199%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80-%22%2C%22x%22%3A713%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R4%22%2C%22x%22%3A837%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R3%22%2C%22x%22%3A785%2C%22y%22%3A311%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A776%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A675%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A733%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22x%22%3A95%2C%22y%22%3A510%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2efed%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc70f45c5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub7da6c07" id="ub7da6c07"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf370dba" id="ubf370dba" style="color: #DF2A3F">为解决上述限制，将式（6）中的确定性 Flow-ODE 转换为等价的 SDE，使其在所有时间步上的边缘概率密度函数均与原始模型一致。构造如下保持边缘分布不变的逆时间 SDE</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uaa44806f" id="uaa44806f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dx_t%3D%5C%5Cleft(v_t(x_t)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cnabla%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x_t)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%2B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dw.%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb44b18f397e5170fe88014fbf9f20779.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zUuKg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u70cf7af0"><li fid="ued462f17" data-lake-id="uc0ff4fee" id="uc0ff4fee"><span data-lake-id="u760a7a44" id="u760a7a44">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dw%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5ecbb2c005336007716515c6265b1b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22biOO7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90a88675" id="u90a88675"> 表示维纳过程的增量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47db06c23eda0f320721582da4e8a231.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xak2W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a48ceb0" id="u8a48ceb0"> 控制生成过程中的随机性强度。对于 Rectified Flow，式（7）可以具体写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0f82f966" id="u0f82f966" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dx_t%3D%5C%5Cleft%5Bv_t(x_t)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B2t%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_t%2B(1-t)v_t(x_t)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%2B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dw.%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd67b4b3c08c455c93051279d405d56cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L0FyJ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub649c879"><li fid="u7acb65ef" data-lake-id="u9716bfc1" id="u9716bfc1"><span data-lake-id="u35052123" id="u35052123">采用 Euler–Maruyama 离散化，可以得到最终的更新规则</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua464403e" id="ua464403e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt%2B%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%3Dx_t%2B%5C%5Cleft%5Bv_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B2t%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_t%2B(1-t)v_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5CDelta%20t%2B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon.%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94aae95cf2403681694784504f9f9d8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GkBnT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u41751013"><li fid="u15a8fb27" data-lake-id="u5e995cf9" id="u5e995cf9"><span data-lake-id="uf0a62f72" id="uf0a62f72">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41747dffa7690162c011ac335f362a99.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r3BLb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u561c8869" id="u561c8869">用于引入随机性。本文采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%3Da%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7B1-t%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc384794e98292df773a864c84413e7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eelLU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50b830ec" id="u50b830ec">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26fdbf8e53cb0e48da5f4ddd4aaf5a5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ISfVT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36d8c1a3" id="u36d8c1a3">是控制噪声强度的标量超参数</span></li><li fid="u15a8fb27" data-lake-id="u120e5a7d" id="u120e5a7d"><span data-lake-id="ud72869ec" id="ud72869ec">式（9）表明，策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cc)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F03231983e32048892126b9d8ed26e8ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hjhMQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f058ba8" id="u5f058ba8">是一个各向同性高斯分布。因此，式（5）中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JWJug%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9aedb23c" id="u9aedb23c">与参考策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pi3hN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c118d33" id="u6c118d33">之间的 KL 散度可以方便地以闭式形式计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u43b2c596" id="u43b2c596" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cbar%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%2B%5C%5CDelta%20t%2C%5C%5Ctheta%7D-%5C%5Cbar%7Bx%7D_%7Bt%2B%5C%5CDelta%20t%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_t(1-t)%7D%7B2t%7D%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E2%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cv_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)-v_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90a21e09ed6d5f733a72aaa96da40a80.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EUtaA%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4053b053" id="u4053b053"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ab16ae2" id="u9ab16ae2">去噪步数缩减：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u57feb09e" id="u57feb09e">为生成高质量图像，流模型通常需要较多去噪步骤，这使在线强化学习的数据收集开销较高。然而，作者发现在线强化学习训练期间并不需要使用如此多的时间步。在生成训练样本时，可以显著减少去噪步数，而在推理时保留原始去噪步数，以获得高质量样本。具体而言，在训练时将步数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22peNSF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8500af1" id="uf8500af1">设为 10，而在推理时采用 SD3.5-M 的原始默认设置，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%3D40%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f6e7496680d0c55f104f3c304261e8a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UMksN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub56e7712" id="ub56e7712">。实验表明，这种方法能够加快训练，同时不损害测试时的图像质量</span></p>